            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Also, if the issue is specifically with slow completion item responses as your project imports more and more dependencies--I feel like I've seen that issue crop up before. tsc/tsserver is notorious for returning thousands of completion items I think.\n\nI don't really know anything about the typescript LSP but it seems odd that it's loading so many different tsconfig json files as you edit, so it has to be related (more and more projects in memory makes it slower to do process any one request maybe).",
