            "body": "No i went back to up to date master branch, but I can try again on yours to see if it behaves differently.\n\nis it still the case regarding `tsc` with typescript go not being a true lsp server? I would believe that with the rewrite they would implement well the LSP.\nAlso when i'm referring to tsc I'm talking about typescript-go as it has been merged to their main repo now, I don't know if it matters here for this issue.",
